From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:17:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1418/3799] soh: rename func_8099B020 ->
 DoorWarp1_HalfBrightIdle

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the WARP_UNK_7 action: holds the warp at half alpha, growing its two scale factors once that alpha is reached, and loops the warp-hole sfx forever.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c
index e93aea49e..de57084ab 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c
@@ -14,7 +14,8 @@ void DoorWarp1_Reset(void);
 
 void DoorWarp1_WarpAppear(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play);
 void DoorWarp1_Destination(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play);
-void func_8099B020(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8099B020: the WARP_UNK_7 action: holds the warp at half alpha, growing its two scale factors once that alpha is reached, and loops the warp-hole sfx forever.
+void DoorWarp1_HalfBrightIdle(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_8099B020 [LLM:HIGH]
 void DoorWarp1_AwaitClearFlag(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play);
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8099A3A4: grows the adult dungeon warp in, fading the light ray and warp body up to full and expanding its scale until it reaches full size, then hands off to DoorWarp1_AdultWarpIdle.
 void DoorWarp1_AdultWarpAppear(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_8099A3A4 [LLM:HIGH]
@@ -193,7 +194,7 @@ void DoorWarp1_SetupWarp(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play) {
             DoorWarp1_SetupAction(this, DoorWarp1_Destination);
             break;
         case WARP_UNK_7:
-            DoorWarp1_SetupAction(this, func_8099B020);
+            DoorWarp1_SetupAction(this, DoorWarp1_HalfBrightIdle);  // was func_8099B020 [LLM:HIGH]
             break;
         default:
             DoorWarp1_SetupAction(this, DoorWarp1_WarpAppear);
@@ -923,7 +924,7 @@ void DoorWarp1_Destination(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play) {
 void DoorWarp1_DoNothing(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
-void func_8099B020(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play) {
+void DoorWarp1_HalfBrightIdle(DoorWarp1* this, PlayState* play) {
     Math_SmoothStepToF(&this->lightRayAlpha, 128.0f, 0.2f, 2.0f, 0.1f);
     Math_SmoothStepToF(&this->warpAlpha, 128.0f, 0.2f, 2.0f, 0.1f);
 
